        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1158147, 12 x 33 Push and Pull Handle Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSet of 12\" Center to Center (CTC)  offset door pull with a 33\" Center to Center (CTC) push bar. Made from 1\" diameter solid aluminum round bar stock. Packaged with heavy duty 3/8\" diameter screw mounting hardware. Fits doors 1-1/2\" to 2-1/4\" thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-1158147_size.jpg?v=1704354600\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1158147 12 x 33 Door Pulls size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/8-x-33-store-door-push-and-pull-handle-set\"><b>8\" x 33\" Push Bar Set</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/9-x-33-store-door-push-and-pull-handle-set\"><b>9\" x 33\" Push Bar Set</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/10-x-33-store-door-push-and-pull-handle-set\"><b>10\" x 33\" Push Bar Set</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 1158147-33CTC Push and Pull Handle Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\" (25 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 3-1/4\" (83 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 2-1/4\" (57 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Offset for Mounting Point: 4\" (100 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Center to Center (CTC): 12\" (305 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Total Length: 13\" (330 mm)</li>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<li>Push Bar Diameter: 1\" (25 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Push Bar  Projection: 2-1/4\" (57 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Push Bar  Clearance: 1-1/4\" (32 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Push Bar  Center to Center (CTC): 33\" (838 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Push Bar Total Length: 34\" (864 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/2\" to 2-1/4\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 3/8-24 Screws</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish to match the common glass store door frame colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set (for 1 door).</b>\r\n</p>",
